# Projects Workspace

This directory contains all projects, applications, and programs created in this workspace.

## Adding a New Project

```powershell
# Create a new project folder
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path "projects/my-new-project"

# Or using the agent
# "Create a new React app called 'my-new-project' in projects/"
```

Each project should be self-contained with its own:
- `package.json` (dependencies)
- `README.md` (documentation)
- `.git/` (version control - optional per-project)